1
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:51,600
Arrogant, are you?

2
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:54,280
Got something to say?

3
00:01:54,360 --> 00:01:55,640
What's that look for?

4
00:01:56,240 --> 00:01:57,280
Are you mad?

5
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:01,840
WU FA

6
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,240
Useless.

7
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:31,360
Who the hell are you
calling useless? Useless?

8
00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:33,480
I'll show you useless! You're useless!

9
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:36,480
Useless!

10
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:41,080
Everyone goes to the lab
to prepare for the competition.

11
00:02:41,160 --> 00:02:42,720
It's not as crowded at night.

12
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:45,000
I'm going to the lab to get some data.

13
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:47,720
That'll teach you.

14
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:54,560
Hey!

15
00:03:07,040 --> 00:03:07,920
Zheng Yu.

16
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:10,320
Are you okay?

17
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:38,240
TRANSFERRING FILE

18
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:05,960
There's only these here.

19
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:08,800
Go to the hospital.

20
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:10,680
No need.

21
00:04:11,440 --> 00:04:12,760
Winter clothing is thick.

22
00:04:13,320 --> 00:04:14,480
I'll be fine.

23
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:18,720
You call that bit of clothing thick?

24
00:04:21,959 --> 00:04:24,480
Help me out. Take a photo
of the back of my neck.

25
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:42,400
Done.

26
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:49,360
It's blurry.

27
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:53,040
My hair is blocking half of it.
Can you do it properly?

28
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:55,760
What use is this?

29
00:04:56,640 --> 00:04:58,080
Go to the hospital.

30
00:04:58,160 --> 00:04:59,680
Get a medical assessment.

31
00:05:01,080 --> 00:05:01,920
No need.

32
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:04,400
Is it about money?

33
00:05:05,400 --> 00:05:07,160
- If so, I can--
- Can you take the photo or not?

34
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:53,760
Done yet?

35
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:18,440
Why didn't you dodge, run,

36
00:06:18,520 --> 00:06:19,840
or scream for help?

37
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:23,560
What if he kept beating you?

38
00:06:23,640 --> 00:06:25,080
It could've been dangerous.

39
00:06:26,120 --> 00:06:27,400
I can't believe

40
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:30,480
someone who has a weak heart
but still wants to play football

41
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:31,480
cherishes life.

42
00:06:38,280 --> 00:06:40,080
Fighting back would have been useless.

43
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:43,360
From the first punch,

44
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:46,680
I could feel how strong he was.

45
00:06:49,280 --> 00:06:50,200
So what do you

46
00:06:50,960 --> 00:06:51,800
plan to do?

47
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:54,200
Private settlement.

48
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:56,920
If you want to negotiate compensation,

49
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,480
you need to find him first.

50
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:00,080
Stay out of it.

51
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:01,520
I have my ways.

52
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:09,880
You were going to the lab, weren't you?

53
00:07:09,960 --> 00:07:10,800
Go on.

54
00:07:13,200 --> 00:07:14,720
I don't have an umbrella.

55
00:07:32,640 --> 00:07:33,840
Fifty-eight yuan each.

56
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:34,840
Buying one?

57
00:07:38,640 --> 00:07:39,760
There's no cheap ones left.

58
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,680
<i>You should get examined.</i>

59
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:18,160
<i>What if you have a bone injury?</i>

60
00:08:18,240 --> 00:08:19,760
ZHENG YU

61
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:26,640
<i>Are you really short on money?</i>

62
00:08:32,760 --> 00:08:33,640
All bullshit.

63
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:46,160
SELLING PERFUME (MINOR FLAW)
ON RQ SECONDHAND GOODS

64
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,480
You came.

65
00:09:20,640 --> 00:09:22,680
<i>Accidentally made too much.</i>

66
00:10:25,680 --> 00:10:29,480
CONGRATULATIONS,
YOUR ITEM HAS BEEN SOLD!

67
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:45,840
<i>Happy birthday.</i>

68
00:10:47,880 --> 00:10:49,200
Birthday?

69
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:54,840
<i>I saw in your profile</i>
<i>that your birthday is today.</i>

70
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:00,360
<i>I randomly filled it in.</i>

71
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:08,440
<i>Thank you.</i>

72
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:13,960
<i>This perfume smells really good.</i>

73
00:11:14,040 --> 00:11:15,800
<i>When you first spray it,</i>

74
00:11:15,880 --> 00:11:17,520
<i>it smells like the rain.</i>

75
00:11:18,280 --> 00:11:19,240
<i>After ten minutes,</i>

76
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:21,920
<i>it transforms into the warmth of sunshine.</i>

77
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:26,880
<i>Then what are the base notes?</i>

78
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:36,640
<i>I couldn't find that online.</i>

79
00:11:39,040 --> 00:11:41,480
LI YANAN

80
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:44,160
Hello?

81
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:45,600
<i>Have you arrived on campus?</i>

82
00:11:46,640 --> 00:11:48,960
<i>You suddenly stopped replying</i>
<i>after a while.</i>

83
00:11:50,560 --> 00:11:51,720
Something happened.

84
00:11:51,800 --> 00:11:52,640
<i>What happened?</i>

85
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:57,920
I saw someone.

86
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:02,600
<i>Someone who seems</i>
<i>to never be able to catch a break.</i>

87
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:08,920
<i>She seems</i>

88
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:10,640
<i>to carry the weight of the world.</i>

89
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:14,840
<i>But when you're wondering</i>

90
00:12:14,920 --> 00:12:17,960
<i>how she even breathes beneath that weight,</i>

91
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:20,040
<i>she starts running.</i>

92
00:12:22,040 --> 00:12:25,240
<i>Why does this person sound so familiar?</i>

93
00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:29,400
<i>Is there a mirror in the lab?</i>

94
00:12:29,480 --> 00:12:31,880
<i>Look in the mirror</i>
<i>and you'll see such a person.</i>

95
00:12:33,920 --> 00:12:34,960
I can't talk anymore.

96
00:12:35,040 --> 00:12:36,600
I really have to go to the lab.

97
00:12:37,760 --> 00:12:40,320
<i>Try being friends with that person.</i>

98
00:12:40,400 --> 00:12:42,320
<i>It's my most genuine piece of advice.</i>

99
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:43,240
<i>All right.</i>

100
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:45,400
<i>Get to work. Remember to rest.</i>

101
00:12:56,400 --> 00:12:57,440
Friends?

102
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:12,280
JI HENG HOSPITAL OF QINGYI CITY

103
00:14:23,920 --> 00:14:25,200
Ms. Zheng.

104
00:14:30,640 --> 00:14:31,880
Where's my work badge?

105
00:14:33,720 --> 00:14:34,920
Hey!

106
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:40,640
"NingSheng BioTech."

107
00:14:41,800 --> 00:14:42,880
Sounds very familiar.

108
00:14:47,400 --> 00:14:49,760
It's my habit to record conversations

109
00:14:49,840 --> 00:14:51,200
with my employees.

110
00:14:51,280 --> 00:14:52,760
I hope you don't mind.

111
00:14:53,680 --> 00:14:55,560
No wonder you could become a director.

112
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:58,560
So what if I'm a director?

113
00:14:59,160 --> 00:15:00,240
We're all the same.

114
00:15:00,320 --> 00:15:01,800
We all work for someone else.

115
00:15:01,880 --> 00:15:04,840
The only difference
is that we just look rather--

116
00:15:04,920 --> 00:15:06,560
Let's get back to business.

117
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:10,920
I sent you the surveillance footage.

118
00:15:11,760 --> 00:15:14,200
I don't need to play it again

119
00:15:14,800 --> 00:15:16,080
in this public area, do I?

120
00:15:22,280 --> 00:15:23,560
No need.

121
00:15:23,640 --> 00:15:24,960
Well,

122
00:15:25,040 --> 00:15:26,000
I…

123
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:28,440
end up like that when I drink too much.

124
00:15:29,040 --> 00:15:30,320
I did it in a daze.

125
00:15:30,920 --> 00:15:32,080
Don't take it to heart.

126
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:34,720
You seemed quite clear-headed.

127
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:39,800
Who would do such a thing while sober?
It does no one any good, right?

128
00:15:40,640 --> 00:15:42,600
In fact, to be honest,

129
00:15:42,680 --> 00:15:45,720
that day, my boss gave me a dressing-down.

130
00:15:45,800 --> 00:15:47,640
Her words were so nasty.

131
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:50,160
As a grown man, how could I tolerate that?

132
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:53,280
So I drank and just lost control.

133
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:55,400
Why didn't you beat your boss?

134
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:56,680
That…

135
00:15:56,760 --> 00:15:57,720
My boss is a woman.

136
00:15:57,800 --> 00:15:59,200
How could I possibly…

137
00:16:03,280 --> 00:16:04,520
"In a daze,"

138
00:16:04,600 --> 00:16:07,640
but you knew to take it out
on someone lower in the hierarchy.

139
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:09,560
"Lost control,"

140
00:16:09,640 --> 00:16:12,120
but when you saw
a man approaching, you fled.

141
00:16:13,760 --> 00:16:15,600
This alcohol you drank

142
00:16:15,680 --> 00:16:17,040
sure is something special.

143
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:21,080
Ms. Zheng,

144
00:16:21,160 --> 00:16:23,640
we're here to discuss compensation, right?

145
00:16:24,480 --> 00:16:25,720
Yes.

146
00:16:25,800 --> 00:16:28,080
On the phone, you demanded 18,000 yuan.

147
00:16:28,160 --> 00:16:29,240
Isn't it a bit much?

148
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:32,280
I assumed you were badly injured.

149
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:34,720
But from the look of you, you seem fine.

150
00:16:34,800 --> 00:16:35,760
Here's what I mean.

151
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:38,680
I'm paying off a mortgage,
and I have kids.

152
00:16:38,760 --> 00:16:39,880
My wife doesn't work.

153
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:41,280
Any promotion is far off.

154
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:43,600
So I'm not as well-off as you think.

155
00:16:46,880 --> 00:16:48,560
If you lose your job,

156
00:16:49,480 --> 00:16:51,200
will you be better off?

157
00:17:00,320 --> 00:17:02,760
SETTLEMENT AGREEMENT

158
00:17:16,760 --> 00:17:19,720
So you're the type of person
who can be bought off.

159
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:22,760
So what if I punched you a few times?

160
00:17:27,599 --> 00:17:30,240
Wow. You even brought help?

161
00:17:34,880 --> 00:17:36,320
Don't forget to pay the bill.

162
00:17:37,240 --> 00:17:38,600
That table's too.

163
00:18:14,760 --> 00:18:15,840
This is for you.

164
00:18:16,840 --> 00:18:19,120
Place it somewhere sunny.

165
00:18:19,840 --> 00:18:21,000
Its flowers last a long time.

166
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:22,960
Don't follow me.

167
00:18:47,320 --> 00:18:48,520
What are you doing?

168
00:18:49,960 --> 00:18:50,920
There you are.

169
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:52,320
Find a seat.

170
00:18:52,400 --> 00:18:54,120
What else could we be doing?

171
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:58,680
We came, so of course we had
to bond with Zhen

172
00:18:58,760 --> 00:19:00,560
and massage her shoulders and legs.

173
00:19:00,640 --> 00:19:01,640
Oh, right.

174
00:19:01,720 --> 00:19:04,160
I helped you dust off the head of the bed.

175
00:19:10,640 --> 00:19:12,320
I've sent you the money.

176
00:19:12,400 --> 00:19:13,440
Leave immediately.

177
00:19:16,400 --> 00:19:18,240
ZHENG YU TRANSFERRED 25,000 YUAN

178
00:19:20,240 --> 00:19:21,920
You're in college now.

179
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:23,520
How come your math

180
00:19:23,600 --> 00:19:25,200
is worse than before?

181
00:19:26,960 --> 00:19:29,400
I'll send the last 5,000 yuan
as soon as possible.

182
00:19:32,720 --> 00:19:33,640
Zheng Yu,

183
00:19:34,520 --> 00:19:36,640
you don't really think

184
00:19:36,720 --> 00:19:39,120
you only owe us 5,000 yuan, do you?

185
00:19:41,400 --> 00:19:44,080
All these years, you took
your mother to get treatment.

186
00:19:44,920 --> 00:19:46,040
I thought

187
00:19:46,120 --> 00:19:50,120
she would at least be able to move
her eyes or twitch her lips by now.

188
00:19:50,200 --> 00:19:51,640
But being here today, I see

189
00:19:51,720 --> 00:19:54,400
that all your money
has gone down the drain.

190
00:19:56,280 --> 00:19:57,920
And these books.

191
00:19:58,560 --> 00:20:00,800
What a stack!
No wonder you're a top student.

192
00:20:02,200 --> 00:20:04,400
These books must have cost a fortune.

193
00:20:06,080 --> 00:20:07,200
Why don't you consider

194
00:20:07,280 --> 00:20:09,640
saving the money spent on books

195
00:20:10,320 --> 00:20:11,920
and giving it to us?

196
00:20:12,000 --> 00:20:12,840
Stop it.

197
00:20:13,560 --> 00:20:14,520
This is a hospital.

198
00:20:17,520 --> 00:20:18,560
Girl,

199
00:20:19,080 --> 00:20:20,960
you should just stop living like this.

200
00:20:21,040 --> 00:20:22,960
We've known each other for years.

201
00:20:23,040 --> 00:20:23,880
Here's an idea.

202
00:20:32,880 --> 00:20:34,120
Go away!

203
00:20:35,640 --> 00:20:37,040
You're just too young

204
00:20:37,120 --> 00:20:38,640
and not ruthless enough.

205
00:20:39,400 --> 00:20:40,880
Get lost.

206
00:20:41,480 --> 00:20:42,440
Leave!

207
00:20:45,920 --> 00:20:47,240
That's all for today.

208
00:20:50,640 --> 00:20:52,440
Saddled with this half-dead person,

209
00:20:52,520 --> 00:20:53,880
you're just wasting money.

210
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:56,000
Plan ahead and buy a burial plot for her.

211
00:20:59,040 --> 00:20:59,880
Are you crazy?

212
00:20:59,960 --> 00:21:01,840
Don't. This is a hospital.

213
00:21:36,280 --> 00:21:37,520
Zheng Yu!

214
00:21:38,840 --> 00:21:40,240
What are you all doing?

215
00:21:40,320 --> 00:21:42,280
Are you the patient's family?

216
00:21:42,880 --> 00:21:44,640
- Get out! Leave!
- You just wait.

217
00:21:44,720 --> 00:21:45,560
Get out!

218
00:21:49,200 --> 00:21:51,960
Break it up! Nothing to see here!

219
00:21:52,040 --> 00:21:53,080
Zheng Yu.

220
00:22:18,680 --> 00:22:19,520
From Ms. Yang.

221
00:22:19,600 --> 00:22:21,440
CHOCOLATE MILK

222
00:22:28,400 --> 00:22:29,840
Instead of getting treatment,

223
00:22:29,920 --> 00:22:32,120
you asked me to take photos
of your injuries.

224
00:22:32,200 --> 00:22:34,000
So it was for leverage.

225
00:22:38,720 --> 00:22:40,520
The compensation money

226
00:22:40,600 --> 00:22:42,960
was for those two people in the ward.

227
00:22:43,040 --> 00:22:44,600
Chen Yanzhou,

228
00:22:45,520 --> 00:22:47,160
haven't you crossed a line?

229
00:22:48,480 --> 00:22:49,920
You followed me to the café

230
00:22:50,000 --> 00:22:51,800
and saw me demand money from him.

231
00:22:51,880 --> 00:22:52,720
That's fine.

232
00:22:53,320 --> 00:22:56,680
Then you followed me to the hospital
and saw me looking so pathetic.

233
00:22:58,840 --> 00:23:00,120
I wanted to bring flowers.

234
00:23:02,600 --> 00:23:03,760
As a friend.

235
00:23:06,320 --> 00:23:07,480
Friend?

236
00:23:09,600 --> 00:23:10,720
Are we friends?

237
00:23:12,880 --> 00:23:15,720
I would rather you treat me as a rival,

238
00:23:15,800 --> 00:23:19,040
someone who can benefit you as a teammate,

239
00:23:19,920 --> 00:23:22,280
than a pitiful classmate.

240
00:23:28,760 --> 00:23:30,920
LU SIQUAN

241
00:23:32,480 --> 00:23:33,560
I'm busy. I'm leaving.

242
00:23:52,600 --> 00:23:54,080
Sorry, I…

243
00:23:54,160 --> 00:23:55,800
You what?

244
00:23:55,880 --> 00:23:58,240
Didn't I tell you to be punctual?

245
00:23:58,320 --> 00:24:00,640
Is it so hard to notify me if you're busy?

246
00:24:00,720 --> 00:24:03,320
I tolerated you
barely coming in on time before.

247
00:24:03,400 --> 00:24:05,480
Today you were a no-show!
What's with that?

248
00:24:08,360 --> 00:24:09,640
It won't happen again.

249
00:24:10,240 --> 00:24:12,360
I was 35 minutes late this time.

250
00:24:12,440 --> 00:24:14,120
Dock my pay as we agreed.

251
00:24:14,200 --> 00:24:15,720
Of course I'll deduct it!

252
00:24:15,800 --> 00:24:17,280
It's double, as we agreed.

253
00:24:19,680 --> 00:24:21,360
You asked for more shifts.

254
00:24:21,440 --> 00:24:22,480
I gave them to you.

255
00:24:22,560 --> 00:24:23,840
Is this how you handle it?

256
00:24:27,560 --> 00:24:30,880
And I don't want to know
how you got that injury on your face.

257
00:24:30,960 --> 00:24:34,080
But if you're in some trouble out there,
I'm not keeping you.

258
00:24:34,160 --> 00:24:36,720
If you really need money, then behave.

259
00:24:36,800 --> 00:24:39,600
<i>Send another 20,000 yuan</i>
<i>before semester starts.</i>

260
00:24:39,680 --> 00:24:42,920
<i>Otherwise, every day of the new semester</i>

261
00:24:43,000 --> 00:24:45,040
<i>will be just like today.</i>

262
00:24:45,120 --> 00:24:45,960
WU FA

263
00:24:48,480 --> 00:24:49,640
Are you listening?

264
00:24:52,400 --> 00:24:53,280
What's wrong?

265
00:24:53,960 --> 00:24:55,080
Can't take a scolding?

266
00:24:56,240 --> 00:24:57,160
Go, hurry.

267
00:24:57,240 --> 00:24:59,520
Finish restocking the shelves.

268
00:25:00,120 --> 00:25:01,280
If you don't work hard,

269
00:25:01,360 --> 00:25:02,480
you can be replaced!

270
00:25:02,560 --> 00:25:04,280
Is being late a capital offense?

271
00:25:09,560 --> 00:25:11,760
This is the first time I've been late.

272
00:25:12,480 --> 00:25:14,360
I agreed to have my pay docked.

273
00:25:15,720 --> 00:25:18,200
Why do you still have to
talk to me like this?

274
00:25:19,840 --> 00:25:22,040
Have you asked me why I'm late?

275
00:25:22,840 --> 00:25:25,000
Have you listened to me
explain my injuries?

276
00:25:25,680 --> 00:25:27,360
If restocking was that urgent,

277
00:25:27,440 --> 00:25:29,640
why were you closing up to go home?

278
00:25:33,600 --> 00:25:35,080
You probably don't know

279
00:25:35,960 --> 00:25:37,320
that living a normal life

280
00:25:38,560 --> 00:25:40,080
is a form of good fortune.

281
00:25:43,400 --> 00:25:45,440
Why can't you fortunate people

282
00:25:46,480 --> 00:25:48,440
have a little more patience

283
00:25:48,520 --> 00:25:50,800
with unfortunate people like us?

284
00:25:51,960 --> 00:25:53,080
Dad.

285
00:25:56,960 --> 00:25:57,880
Dad.

286
00:26:01,320 --> 00:26:02,360
Dad.

287
00:26:03,280 --> 00:26:04,800
Son. Sir, I'm sorry.

288
00:26:04,880 --> 00:26:05,880
I'm late today.

289
00:26:05,960 --> 00:26:07,320
I'm sorry for being late.

290
00:26:07,400 --> 00:26:09,680
Mr. Lu, it's all right.

291
00:26:10,760 --> 00:26:12,280
It's only a 15-minute walk.

292
00:26:12,880 --> 00:26:15,400
I was going to wait
with Xiaoyang at reception,

293
00:26:16,000 --> 00:26:17,080
but he was impatient.

294
00:26:17,160 --> 00:26:19,880
Maybe it's because you're usually on time.

295
00:26:19,960 --> 00:26:21,000
You were late today,

296
00:26:21,920 --> 00:26:22,840
so he was worried.

297
00:26:22,920 --> 00:26:24,920
I'm really sorry for troubling you.

298
00:26:25,000 --> 00:26:26,480
No, it's the least I could do.

299
00:26:27,320 --> 00:26:29,240
- I'll let you go.
- Okay, take care.

300
00:26:32,240 --> 00:26:33,080
Son.

301
00:26:34,480 --> 00:26:35,480
Looking for cookies?

302
00:26:37,320 --> 00:26:39,800
Fruity yogurt milk is on the left.

303
00:26:39,880 --> 00:26:42,560
Bear cookies are behind it.

304
00:26:43,280 --> 00:26:45,280
- Fruity yogurt is right here!
- Here!

305
00:26:46,120 --> 00:26:47,800
- Bear cookies…
- Bear…

306
00:26:47,880 --> 00:26:50,800
- Bear cookies are right here.
- I can't find them.

307
00:26:50,880 --> 00:26:51,800
- Dad.
- Here you go.

308
00:26:51,880 --> 00:26:54,080
- I can't find them.
- They're all yours.

309
00:26:54,160 --> 00:26:55,840
- Here, be careful.
- Bear cookies!

310
00:26:55,920 --> 00:26:56,960
Come on.

311
00:27:26,480 --> 00:27:28,560
Bear cookies!

312
00:28:03,480 --> 00:28:04,960
If you want to fire me,

313
00:28:05,680 --> 00:28:06,720
I accept it.

314
00:28:08,040 --> 00:28:09,520
<i>I haven't hired you yet.</i>

315
00:28:09,600 --> 00:28:10,760
<i>How can I fire you?</i>

316
00:28:12,800 --> 00:28:14,720
GAO XING'S MOTHER

317
00:28:18,600 --> 00:28:19,880
Sorry about that.

318
00:28:20,520 --> 00:28:22,480
What were you calling about?

319
00:28:22,560 --> 00:28:23,880
<i>Ms. Xiaozheng,</i>

320
00:28:23,960 --> 00:28:25,400
<i>during this winter break,</i>

321
00:28:25,480 --> 00:28:27,160
<i>Gao Xing will be in your care.</i>

322
00:28:32,080 --> 00:28:34,920
<i>So what happened with you and your friend?</i>

323
00:28:35,000 --> 00:28:35,960
What friend?

324
00:28:36,720 --> 00:28:39,440
<i>The one who can never catch a break.</i>

325
00:28:43,560 --> 00:28:44,640
Nothing.

326
00:28:44,720 --> 00:28:46,720
We're incompatible. We can't be friends.

327
00:28:46,800 --> 00:28:48,640
If it's not thesis-related, then bye.

328
00:29:14,800 --> 00:29:15,840
Coming.

329
00:29:22,640 --> 00:29:23,960
Come on in.

330
00:29:30,800 --> 00:29:32,560
- Here.
- Thank you.

331
00:29:57,520 --> 00:29:58,640
Ms. Xiaozheng,

332
00:30:01,200 --> 00:30:03,440
I will be away on business for a while.

333
00:30:03,520 --> 00:30:07,400
A helper will come over
to cook and clean regularly.

334
00:30:07,480 --> 00:30:08,800
But the rest of the time,

335
00:30:08,880 --> 00:30:10,760
I want to ask you to spend more time

336
00:30:12,360 --> 00:30:13,320
with Gao Xing.

337
00:30:15,800 --> 00:30:18,520
You're both young.
You're sure to get along, right?

338
00:30:20,840 --> 00:30:22,840
If there is any problem, message me.

339
00:30:23,680 --> 00:30:25,360
Wages are paid daily, right?

340
00:30:26,960 --> 00:30:28,120
Of course.

341
00:30:36,920 --> 00:30:37,880
I'm coming in.

342
00:30:51,040 --> 00:30:52,520
I accidentally tripped.

343
00:30:53,560 --> 00:30:55,440
Did you do the homework I assigned?

344
00:30:56,160 --> 00:30:57,320
All done.

345
00:31:01,880 --> 00:31:02,760
Not bad.

346
00:31:03,360 --> 00:31:05,360
At least you were willing to spend time

347
00:31:05,440 --> 00:31:06,400
copying answers.

348
00:31:11,680 --> 00:31:13,880
Senior high school biology isn't hard.

349
00:31:13,960 --> 00:31:15,480
Rote memorization is the key.

350
00:31:15,560 --> 00:31:17,160
You're a Qing Yi University student.

351
00:31:17,240 --> 00:31:18,760
Junior, Life Sciences.

352
00:31:18,840 --> 00:31:21,320
However, it's not just memorizing terms.

353
00:31:21,400 --> 00:31:23,360
Instead, you go from the "what"

354
00:31:23,440 --> 00:31:24,680
to the "why" and "how."

355
00:31:24,760 --> 00:31:27,400
Does your college have
a lot of really smart people?

356
00:31:27,480 --> 00:31:30,120
So you have to understand
the underlying logic.

357
00:31:30,200 --> 00:31:31,600
- Do you know--
- Gao Xing.

358
00:31:31,680 --> 00:31:35,240
Did your mom hire me
to chit-chat with you?

359
00:31:35,320 --> 00:31:38,840
She would be happy to hire someone
who could get along with me.

360
00:31:51,440 --> 00:31:52,800
Let's begin the lesson.

361
00:32:22,240 --> 00:32:24,320
LU SIQUAN

362
00:32:26,080 --> 00:32:28,200
- Hello?
<i>- Why aren't you here yet?</i>

363
00:32:28,280 --> 00:32:30,400
<i>Are you thinking of skipping again?</i>

364
00:32:36,720 --> 00:32:38,040
I'm still on the way.

365
00:32:38,800 --> 00:32:39,760
I'll be there soon.

366
00:32:40,600 --> 00:32:41,480
<i>Hurry up.</i>

367
00:33:09,560 --> 00:33:10,920
Check your watch.

368
00:33:11,000 --> 00:33:12,200
What time is it now?

369
00:33:12,880 --> 00:33:14,080
You're getting bold,

370
00:33:14,160 --> 00:33:15,960
leaving without a word.

371
00:33:17,640 --> 00:33:18,680
I thought

372
00:33:19,280 --> 00:33:21,320
you didn't want to see me anymore.

373
00:33:22,400 --> 00:33:24,760
Stop standing there.
Get changed and start work.

374
00:33:27,800 --> 00:33:29,520
Always wasting time.

375
00:33:40,320 --> 00:33:41,520
Thank you.

376
00:33:56,040 --> 00:33:57,920
Okay, that's about it.

377
00:33:58,000 --> 00:34:02,720
Just go home and find some time
to revise the parts I talked about.

378
00:34:02,800 --> 00:34:03,880
- Okay.
- Okay. Bye, sir.

379
00:34:03,960 --> 00:34:06,400
- Happy Lunar New Year.
- Happy Lunar New Year, sir. Bye.

380
00:34:11,880 --> 00:34:14,880
You don't have to join
the Spring Festival travel rush.

381
00:34:14,960 --> 00:34:16,199
Why do you come so often?

382
00:34:16,800 --> 00:34:18,040
I have a lot to do.

383
00:34:18,120 --> 00:34:20,199
You two finished the final draft early.

384
00:34:20,280 --> 00:34:21,639
There aren't many issues.

385
00:34:21,719 --> 00:34:23,600
It will come down to the defense.

386
00:34:24,440 --> 00:34:25,560
She should be fine.

387
00:34:27,080 --> 00:34:29,920
Even if you two split the work
and she does the defense,

388
00:34:30,000 --> 00:34:32,520
you can't just wash your hands of it.

389
00:34:35,480 --> 00:34:36,560
That's how she prefers it.

390
00:34:37,639 --> 00:34:38,800
How can you say that?

391
00:34:38,880 --> 00:34:42,760
Two people in a partnership
should help and support each other.

392
00:34:42,840 --> 00:34:45,120
You were accused of cheating.

393
00:34:45,199 --> 00:34:48,000
Zheng Yu chose to trust you
and helped clear your name.

394
00:34:49,920 --> 00:34:50,960
Helped clear my name?

395
00:34:51,040 --> 00:34:52,120
Didn't you know?

396
00:34:53,920 --> 00:34:56,400
That Xie Yudi didn't want to help you.

397
00:34:56,480 --> 00:34:59,120
He only went to tell the advisor
because of Zheng Yu.

398
00:34:59,200 --> 00:35:01,520
I heard it from your advisor.

399
00:35:02,120 --> 00:35:04,880
Zheng Yu is a very good kid.

400
00:35:04,960 --> 00:35:06,680
Her family is poor.

401
00:35:06,760 --> 00:35:08,360
If not for clearing your name,

402
00:35:08,440 --> 00:35:12,720
she could have pretended not to know
and gotten the Vitality Award.

403
00:35:12,800 --> 00:35:14,800
I have plans. I have to go.

404
00:35:26,680 --> 00:35:27,720
Where are you?

405
00:35:28,440 --> 00:35:30,200
<i>On my way to the old lab.</i>

406
00:35:31,080 --> 00:35:32,080
Wait for me.

407
00:35:41,600 --> 00:35:42,640
Zheng Yu.

408
00:36:07,720 --> 00:36:08,560
What do you want?

409
00:36:11,080 --> 00:36:12,240
Thank you.

410
00:36:14,280 --> 00:36:16,240
You helped clear my name.

411
00:36:17,200 --> 00:36:20,240
I was helping myself
in case it affected the competition.

412
00:36:22,000 --> 00:36:23,480
Really?

413
00:36:23,560 --> 00:36:24,440
Of course.

414
00:36:26,280 --> 00:36:29,480
If we win the Excellence Cup,
things will be better, right?

415
00:36:32,920 --> 00:36:35,280
I mean for both of us.

416
00:36:36,440 --> 00:36:37,880
You'll get the prize money,

417
00:36:37,960 --> 00:36:41,120
and I can shut up those people
who mocked me on the forum.

418
00:36:42,560 --> 00:36:43,440
What's your point?

419
00:36:45,480 --> 00:36:46,840
I followed you last time

420
00:36:46,920 --> 00:36:49,040
out of concern for you as a friend.

421
00:36:49,640 --> 00:36:52,240
But that made you uncomfortable.

422
00:36:53,120 --> 00:36:55,760
I should apologize to you. I'm sorry.

423
00:36:57,520 --> 00:36:59,720
That day, you said we aren't friends.

424
00:37:00,600 --> 00:37:04,080
But even if we can't be friends,

425
00:37:04,160 --> 00:37:06,600
we're at least comrades for now.

426
00:37:08,080 --> 00:37:09,080
So

427
00:37:09,160 --> 00:37:10,840
this time,

428
00:37:12,720 --> 00:37:14,280
let's win together.

429
00:38:25,040 --> 00:38:27,200
I sent you
the latest version of the slides.

430
00:38:28,040 --> 00:38:29,160
I saw it.

431
00:38:29,240 --> 00:38:30,680
Leave the rest to me.

432
00:38:30,760 --> 00:38:33,280
You should enjoy the Lunar New Year.

433
00:38:33,960 --> 00:38:35,880
Contact me if you have any issues.

434
00:38:35,960 --> 00:38:36,840
I'll be online.

435
00:38:39,600 --> 00:38:41,280
Do you have plans for the holiday?

436
00:38:44,040 --> 00:38:45,240
The same as usual.

437
00:38:47,720 --> 00:38:50,040
Then I wish you happy holidays.

438
00:38:54,000 --> 00:38:55,240
Same to you.

439
00:39:09,080 --> 00:39:10,480
How is there so much stuff?

440
00:39:12,120 --> 00:39:14,760
Old bath towel, one, two.

441
00:39:15,520 --> 00:39:18,480
Zheng Yu, have you bought a ticket home?

442
00:39:19,920 --> 00:39:20,840
Not yet.

443
00:39:20,920 --> 00:39:22,360
Then you should hurry.

444
00:39:23,720 --> 00:39:25,360
We're all leaving today.

445
00:39:27,040 --> 00:39:28,680
Safe travels.

446
00:39:34,080 --> 00:39:37,320
Fangli, let me help you,
or you will miss your flight.

447
00:39:37,400 --> 00:39:38,520
BIOLOGY REVIEW PROBLEMS

448
00:39:39,960 --> 00:39:42,240
We won't go over your mistakes today.

449
00:39:42,320 --> 00:39:43,160
We won't?

450
00:39:43,800 --> 00:39:45,720
It would take longer than one session.

451
00:39:47,840 --> 00:39:49,280
I'm not criticizing you.

452
00:39:49,880 --> 00:39:52,560
Discussing each problem would mean
covering many different concepts.

453
00:39:52,640 --> 00:39:54,640
You wouldn't remember everything.

454
00:39:54,720 --> 00:39:57,120
So let's use a different approach.

455
00:39:59,600 --> 00:40:02,240
Here. I compiled these notes for you.

456
00:40:04,640 --> 00:40:06,360
You can find the answers in here

457
00:40:06,440 --> 00:40:08,600
or ask me up to three times.

458
00:40:08,680 --> 00:40:12,240
I'll give you 40 minutes
to correct this exercise sheet.

459
00:40:13,120 --> 00:40:14,640
I can do it in ten minutes.

460
00:40:14,720 --> 00:40:16,040
I'll search online…

461
00:40:16,720 --> 00:40:19,400
You can only use the notebook.
Use it every day.

462
00:40:20,440 --> 00:40:22,880
This is like an amusement park guidebook.

463
00:40:22,960 --> 00:40:25,640
Where is the carousel?
Where is the roller coaster?

464
00:40:25,720 --> 00:40:27,120
Memorize everything.

465
00:40:27,200 --> 00:40:29,280
Because when it's time to go play,

466
00:40:29,360 --> 00:40:30,680
there is no GPS.

467
00:40:30,760 --> 00:40:31,680
I hate parks.

468
00:40:31,760 --> 00:40:32,720
It's a metaphor.

469
00:40:35,480 --> 00:40:36,720
Begin.

470
00:40:40,120 --> 00:40:41,560
PLANT CELL STRUCTURE

471
00:40:41,640 --> 00:40:42,640
SECRETORY PROTEINS

472
00:40:44,640 --> 00:40:48,960
These single-celled organisms…

473
00:40:49,600 --> 00:40:51,160
- I have a question.
- Go ahead.

474
00:40:52,200 --> 00:40:55,080
Both paramecia and amoebas
are single-celled organisms.

475
00:40:55,160 --> 00:40:57,680
So why is amoeba used to call someone dumb

476
00:40:57,760 --> 00:40:58,840
instead of paramecium?

477
00:41:01,160 --> 00:41:02,320
Is this relevant?

478
00:41:09,640 --> 00:41:10,480
Ms. Zheng,

479
00:41:10,560 --> 00:41:12,840
can you come a little later tomorrow?

480
00:41:13,440 --> 00:41:14,720
I'm not coming tomorrow.

481
00:41:15,280 --> 00:41:16,760
No way.

482
00:41:16,840 --> 00:41:18,560
Are you angry?

483
00:41:20,360 --> 00:41:22,560
Did you look at the lesson schedule?

484
00:41:25,480 --> 00:41:26,920
There is no lesson tomorrow.

485
00:41:27,520 --> 00:41:30,000
You should've said so!

486
00:41:30,640 --> 00:41:32,640
But I have two exam papers for you.

487
00:41:40,680 --> 00:41:42,360
GAO XING'S MOTHER

488
00:41:42,440 --> 00:41:44,680
<i>Hello, Ms. Chen.</i>

489
00:41:44,760 --> 00:41:47,040
<i>Let me provide an update</i>
<i>on the current plan.</i>

490
00:41:47,640 --> 00:41:50,240
<i>Gao Xing has only progressed</i>
<i>to </i>Compulsory Volume 1<i>,</i>

491
00:41:50,320 --> 00:41:52,520
<i>so the concepts covered are</i>
<i>relatively basic.</i>

492
00:41:52,600 --> 00:41:54,840
<i>I will later add</i>
Compulsory Volume 2 <i>content</i>

493
00:41:54,920 --> 00:41:57,240
<i>to give Gao Xing a head start</i>
<i>and ensure a smooth transition.</i>

494
00:42:04,520 --> 00:42:05,840
YEAR 1 HIGH SCHOOL BIOLOGY EXAM

495
00:42:18,960 --> 00:42:20,120
Hello.

496
00:42:20,200 --> 00:42:22,480
Your assignment for tomorrow is in my bag.

497
00:42:22,560 --> 00:42:25,400
<i>Ms. Zheng, how could you be so careless?</i>

498
00:42:27,200 --> 00:42:29,720
Am I careless, or are you cunning?

499
00:42:29,800 --> 00:42:31,160
I'm bringing it back now.

500
00:42:31,240 --> 00:42:32,400
<i>I'm not at home.</i>

501
00:42:32,480 --> 00:42:35,040
<i>I'm having dinner</i>
<i>at my uncle's house. Right, Uncle?</i>

502
00:42:35,120 --> 00:42:36,440
<i>Yes.</i>

503
00:42:36,520 --> 00:42:39,240
<i>Why don't you leave it at my doorstep?</i>

504
00:42:40,240 --> 00:42:41,600
I'm afraid if I do that,

505
00:42:41,680 --> 00:42:44,080
you will tell me tomorrow
that it got blown away.

506
00:42:44,160 --> 00:42:47,120
<i>Then come to my uncle's house.</i>
<i>It's in the same area.</i>

507
00:42:47,200 --> 00:42:48,480
In the same area?

508
00:42:48,560 --> 00:42:51,960
<i>Yes, Building 14.</i>
<i>I'll give you ten minutes.</i>

509
00:42:52,040 --> 00:42:54,360
<i>Ms. Zheng, hurry and run.</i>

510
00:43:25,920 --> 00:43:26,920
Zheng Yu?
